  "text": "You are looking stunning in a coral-colored cocktail dress featuring large black floral prints, which creates a bold and expressive look perfect for standing out at your New Year's celebration. The dark green patent leather ballet flats with their distinctive gold buckle provide a sophisticated contrast that grounds the vibrant top half of your ensemble, while the deep brown suede crossbody bag offers an earthy, elegant anchor to complete the outfit.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Keep your makeup warm and defined to match the intensity of the coral dress, letting the black print on the skirt do the heavy lifting for a night out.",
    "Feel free to take off the brown crossbody bag once you arrive at the restaurant to keep your silhouette clean and elegant while dining."
