    {
      "n": "#152·26",
      "text": "This is a knee-length cocktail dress in a vibrant coral hue, featuring an intricate print of large black flowers across the bodice and skirt. The fabric appears to have a slight sheen, adding to its festive feel, while the silhouette is fitted through the hips before flaring gently at the hem where it meets a subtle black trim."
    },
    {
      "n": "#81·33",
      "text": "These are sleek ballet flats made from glossy dark green patent leather. They feature a classic shape with a low profile and are distinguished by a decorative gold-tone metal detail on the vamp, adding a touch of refinement suitable for an evening event."
    },
    {
      "n": "#247·21",
      "text": "This is a structured crossbody bag crafted from soft brown suede. It has two top handles and a secure closure highlighted by a leather tag with a gold-tone padlock detail, providing a chic and practical accessory for the evening."
    }
  ]
